{"version":1,"key":"card:154","content":{"id":154,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"f338bcf1-530f-4fb4-ad07-070e07b746f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个元素有可能会被多个选择器选中，并且被应用相同的样式，这种情况我们称之为样式"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"层叠"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"ef852b44-6124-4a6b-98c7-7ff7dac2d69c","collabId":"5632b450-b55e-46d0-b1e2-93b759aa1144","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <title>层叠</title>\n    <style>\n      div {\n        color: green;\n      }\n      .red {\n        color: red;\n      }\n      #box {\n        color: brown;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"red\" id=\"box\" style=\"color: gray\">一段文字</div>\n  </body>\n</html>"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"780d5613-614c-4687-92bd-f943dc40beb6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述的 div 标签被四个选择器选中，并且同时设置了 color 属性，那么哪个属性会生效呢？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"659d8c4e-020a-4f51-a81d-003602f6b36e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就牵涉到选择器优先级的问题了，优先级大小规则如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"2d588426-405a-4c31-84e8-b51077c95a0a","collabId":"c9d4c598-53ad-4d4a-9c54-fa5ab504683a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"行内样式 > id 选择器 > 类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器 > 标签选择器"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"8e7e204d-9515-4fa6-9604-a273b2b0cac5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以上面行内样式会生效，文字颜色显示为 gray 灰色。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"f7c17f86-7667-409a-88a2-af17862aded1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面明确了单个选择器优先级的排序，但是对于组合选择器，是多个选择器的组合，它们的优先级又是如何? 它会按照如下顺序进行比较："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"645fb1f5-76ca-4fec-abd7-4af1929f365e","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ea0021bb-4f6b-4cb8-bb2b-b7317eb31da6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"36d0272b-791c-45c2-bcd1-b37fca248c00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"id 选择器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"5524986d-6644-4a4f-b229-e9f7933f513b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"bef4f95a-33b1-4977-854a-0fb51ac0fcfb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"bc14879c-f2e1-4a0c-b725-c4272eb4b114","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"918c88ad-2674-4619-843c-08132aea2491","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签选择器"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"d15a7a13-dd54-4fdc-b3e9-5b8bb92473f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先会比较选择器中 id 选择器的个数，个数多的优先级高，如果个数相同，则继续比较类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器这三个选择器个数之和的大小，个数多的优先级高；如果还相同，则继续比较标签选择器的个数，个数多的选择器优先级高。如果比对完个数都相同，那么就看定义的顺序，定义在后面的选择器有高的优先级。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","collabId":"5f1dbb3f-f119-4434-9280-6bd8fd2cc17e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"45770483-2a0d-43ec-a7bb-8932b7aa90d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无论有多少个选择器，行内样式的优先级都比它们高！"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"1a5e9bb1-aacb-4ecc-9b30-3c9b9917b6eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在写样式的时候，我们可能会发现写的样式没有生效，排除拼写错误，很有可能是你的选择器优先级不够，这个时候你可能会在选择器上加上其他选择器，例如 id 选择器来提高它的优先级。那还有一种方法就是在样式的末尾加上 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"7cb212f7-57d4-42d1-9942-741089ce4b8b","collabId":"5219acb3-0af8-4570-9c59-d83f85489d6a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".container p {\n  color: red;\n}\np {\n  color: blue;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"87e02b67-9045-4899-8347-96875d5db8f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面的选择器的优先级没有上面的高，这时我们可以在样式后添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"f3d88da1-fee2-4353-8a14-8b9a28e24a80","collabId":"2bf7d71c-8144-4ec8-991f-b0c45cdbdd98","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"p {\n  color: blue !important;\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"387cb8bd-c5f8-4b47-bf87-edf184ff79cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!important"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以使该条样式无视选择器的优先级，或者说将优先级提升为最高级别，使得被选中的标签使用该样式。"}]}],"tags":["CSS"],"createTime":1690211480204,"updateTime":1792286709621,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1792286709621}}